'\\n\\nIf successful:\\n  → \\\"File '{filename}' downloaded successfully.\\\"\\nElse:\\n  → \\\"SFTP download failed.\\\"\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nFINAL RESPONSE RULES\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Respond ONLY based on tool output.\\n- Provide ONE short final status message.\\n- Do NOT include commands or raw logs.\\n- Do NOT explain logic.\\n- Do NOT mention tools, workflows, or automation.\\n- Never fabricate output.\\n\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nABSOLUTE RESTRICTIONS\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\n- Never fabricate tool output.\\n- Never reorder steps.\\n- Never split SFTP commands.\\n- Never use multiple tools in one step.\\n- Never act without a trigger.\\n\\nHuman: check sftp\\nAI: [Used tools: Tool: Ftp_status, Input: {}, Result: [{\\\"code\\\":0,\\\"signal\\\":null,\\\"stdout\\\":\\\"sftp> ls\\\\nDesktop      Documents    Downloads    Music        Pictures     Public       \\\\nTemplates    Videos       message.txt  paul         sample       snap         \\\\ntest.txt     uploads\\\",\\\"stderr\\\":\\\"Connected to 192.168.56.103.\\\"}]] SFTP server is reachable. Files:\\nDesktop      Documents    Downloads    Music        Pictures     Public      \\nTemplates    Videos       message.txt  paul         sample       snap        \\ntest.txt     uploads\\nHuman: put sample\\nAI: Please provide the filename you want to upload.\\nHuman: sample\"],\"options\":{\"mistral_api_key\":{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"secret\",\"id\":[\"MISTRAL_API_KEY\"]},\"model\":\"magistral-medium-latest\",\"metadata\":{\"output_format\":\"json\"}},\"response\":{\"response\":{\"generations\":[[{\"text\":\"\",\"generationInfo\":{\"finishReason\":\"tool_calls\"}}]]},\"tokenUsage\":{\"completionTokens\":44,\"promptTokens\":1427,\"totalTokens\":1471}}}"}}
